      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SUPER LEAGUE (3) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by a nose at Q Lakeside in a handy 25.36. Fair draw can see a good run and has a good record over this journey. Is yet to miss the placings from this draw, including four wins, from seven starts. Can continue on his winning ways. LADY ELLOISE (6) goes very well this course and distance starting eight times for four wins and two minors. Missed the frame latest (22.09) when fifth over 390m at Q Lakeside in a Grade 5. Looks a key chance on best figures. NAME OF LOVE (1) held his own to the line last start and filled a minor placing, beaten only half a length (19.58) behind Hey Ernie at this track. Expected to feature again. WARREGO RAIN (7) form at this distance reads well.",
